<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:20:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>卢拉任命布拉德斯科董事长为财务主管以安抚市场</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-taps-bradesco-chairman-as-finance-chief-to-reassure-markets</link><description>巴西总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦任命布拉德斯科主席路易斯·卡洛斯·特拉布科·卡皮担任财政部长，并求助于巴西最著名的银行家之一，以恢复投资者对国家财政的信心。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-taps-bradesco-chairman-as-finance-chief-to-reassure-markets'&gt;卢拉任命布拉德斯科董事长为财务主管以安抚市场&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Lula Taps Bradesco Chair as Finance Chief to Soothe Markets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-taps-bradesco-chairman-as-finance-chief-to-reassure-markets</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:18:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:05:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</link><description>交易员权衡美联储加息的前景与美国科技股反弹推动的更广泛市场复苏，金价企稳。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week'&gt;美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Steadies as Fed Rate Path and AI Stocks Frame Volatile Week&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:53:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stocks Rise for Second Day, Crude Oil Gains: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国关税计划面临阻力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/us-plans-for-tariffs-face-pushback-video</link><description>贸易伙伴对美国最新关税计划的反应既失望又抗议，但一些贸易伙伴仍抱有谈判的前景。彭博社驻北亚记者 Minmin Low 表示，中国和欧盟已明确表示，如有必要，他们将进行报复。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/us-plans-for-tariffs-face-pushback-video'&gt;美国关税计划面临阻力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Plans for Tariffs Face Pushback&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/us-plans-for-tariffs-face-pushback-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:15:56 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>